    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>RustDesk是一款开源远程桌面软件，本文将详细介绍如何使用Docker部署RustDesk服务器及其API服务。</p><h2 id="一、准备工作"><a href="#一、准备工作" class="headerlink" title="一、准备工作"></a>一、准备工作</h2><h3 id="1-环境要求"><a href="#1-环境要求" class="headerlink" title="1. 环境要求"></a>1. 环境要求</h3><ul><li>Docker 和 Docker Compose</li><li>服务器一台</li><li>域名或公网IP地址</li></ul><h3 id="2-相关资源"><a href="#2-相关资源" class="headerlink" title="2. 相关资源"></a>2. 相关资源</h3><ul><li>RustDesk API项目：<a href="https://github.com/lejianwen/rustdesk-api">lejianwen&#x2F;rustdesk-api</a> (官方免费版不支持web api，无法登录和管理)</li><li>官方文档：<a href="https://github.com/lejianwen/rustdesk-api/wiki/Use-Docker-With-Rustdesk-Server-S6">Use Docker With Rustdesk-Server-S6</a></li></ul><h2 id="二、部署步骤"><a href="#二、部署步骤" class="headerlink" title="二、部署步骤"></a>二、部署步骤</h2><h3 id="1-创建Docker-Compose文件"><a href="#1-创建Docker-Compose文件" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建Docker Compose文件"></a>1. 创建Docker Compose文件</h3><p>提供了直接自定义key的方法，还需要修改一些配置。我选择<code>直接替换key文件</code>的方式：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">networks:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rustdesk-net:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">external:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">services:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rustdesk-server:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">rustdesk-server</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21115</span><span class="string">:21115</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21116</span><span class="string">:21116</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21116</span><span class="string">:21116/udp</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21117</span><span class="string">:21117</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21118</span><span class="string">:21118</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21119</span><span class="string">:21119</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">rustdesk/rustdesk-server-s6:latest</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">environment:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RELAY=&lt;server[:21117]&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">ENCRYPTED_ONLY=1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">/data/rustdesk/server:/data</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rustdesk-api:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">container_name:</span> <span class="string">rustdesk-api</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="number">21114</span><span class="string">:21114</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">lejianwen/rustdesk-api</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">environment:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">TZ=Asia/Shanghai</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RUSTDESK_API_RUSTDESK_ID_SERVER=&lt;server[:21116]&gt;</span> <span class="comment"># 21116端口</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RUSTDESK_API_RUSTDESK_RELAY_SERVER=&lt;server[:21117]&gt;</span> <span class="comment"># 21117端口</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">RUSTDESK_API_RUSTDESK_API_SERVER=http://&lt;server[:21114]&gt;</span> <span class="comment"># 21114端口</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="comment">#- RUSTDESK_API_RUSTDESK_KEY=&lt;key&gt; # 可选：直接指定key</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">/data/rustdesk/api:/app/data</span> <span class="comment"># 将数据库挂载</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">/data/rustdesk/server:/app/conf/data</span> <span class="comment"># 挂载key文件到api容器，可不用设置RUSTDESK_API_RUSTDESK_KEY</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">networks:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">rustdesk-net</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">depends_on:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">rustdesk-server</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、使用指南"><a href="#三、使用指南" class="headerlink" title="三、使用指南"></a>三、使用指南</h2><h3 id="1-客户端连接"><a href="#1-客户端连接" class="headerlink" title="1. 客户端连接"></a>1. 客户端连接</h3><p>启动服务后，可以在日志中看到生成的<code>key</code></p><img src="/2025/12/23/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8Docker%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2RustDesk%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8/image-20251223105729175.png" class="" title="image-20251223105729175.png"><h4 id="客户端设置"><a href="#客户端设置" class="headerlink" title="客户端设置"></a>客户端设置</h4><p>直接使用官方客户端就行</p><p>高手可以试试用github生成自己的客户端(可以把配置信息写进入)</p><ul><li>id服务器&#x2F;中继服务器  直接使用IP即可</li><li>api服务器  需要使用 http+ip+端口的格式</li><li>key  就是刚才日志里显示的key</li></ul><img src="/2025/12/23/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8Docker%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2RustDesk%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8/image-20251223105820499.png" class="" title="image-20251223105820499.png"><h3 id="2-登录"><a href="#2-登录" class="headerlink" title="2. 登录"></a>2. 登录</h3><p>这个镜像的默认密码是 admin admin</p><p>可以访问 <code>ip:21114</code> 端口登录web界面，也可以在客户端登录</p><h3 id="3-CLI设置"><a href="#3-CLI设置" class="headerlink" title="3. CLI设置"></a>3. CLI设置</h3><p>比较重要的设置是重置admin密码：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看帮助</span></span><br><span class="line">./apimain -h</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="重置管理员密码"><a href="#重置管理员密码" class="headerlink" title="重置管理员密码"></a>重置管理员密码</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">./apimain reset-admin-pwd &lt;<span class="built_in">pwd</span>&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="帮助信息"><a href="#帮助信息" class="headerlink" title="帮助信息"></a>帮助信息</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">/app <span class="comment"># ./apimain -h</span></span><br><span class="line">RUSTDESK API SERVER</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Usage:</span><br><span class="line">  apimain [flags]</span><br><span class="line">  apimain [<span class="built_in">command</span>]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Available Commands:</span><br><span class="line">  completion      Generate the autocompletion script <span class="keyword">for</span> the specified shell</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="built_in">help</span>            Help about any <span class="built_in">command</span></span><br><span class="line">  reset-admin-pwd Reset Admin Password</span><br><span class="line">  reset-pwd       Reset User Password</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Flags:</span><br><span class="line">  -c, --config string   choose config file (default <span class="string">&quot;./conf/config.yaml&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  -h, --<span class="built_in">help</span>            <span class="built_in">help</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> apimain</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Use <span class="string">&quot;apimain [command] --help&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> more information about a <span class="built_in">command</span>.</span><br><span class="line">/app <span class="comment"># ./apimain reset-admin-pwd --help</span></span><br><span class="line">Reset Admin Password</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Usage:</span><br><span class="line">  apimain reset-admin-pwd [<span class="built_in">pwd</span>] [flags]</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Examples:</span><br><span class="line">reset-admin-pwd 123456</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Flags:</span><br><span class="line">  -h, --<span class="built_in">help</span>   <span class="built_in">help</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> reset-admin-pwd</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Global Flags:</span><br><span class="line">  -c, --config string   choose config file (default <span class="string">&quot;./conf/config.yaml&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">/app <span class="comment">#</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="四、备份策略"><a href="#四、备份策略" class="headerlink" title="四、备份策略"></a>四、备份策略</h2><p>如果之前设置了文件映射，可以直接备份映射目录，比如我的文件位置在 <code>/data/rustdesk/server</code></p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">/data/rustdesk/server:/data</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果之前没有备份过，可以在宿主机使用以下命令从容器中复制数据，然后在新服务器上恢复：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 基础命令：将rustdesk容器的/data目录备份到宿主机/root/rustdesk_backup/目录（自动创建目录）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> -p /root/rustdesk_backup &amp;&amp;</span><br><span class="line">docker <span class="built_in">cp</span> &lt;你的容器名称&gt;:/data /root/rustdesk_backup/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、总结"><a href="#五、总结" class="headerlink" title="五、总结"></a>五、总结</h2><p>通过Docker部署RustDesk服务器和API服务，可以快速搭建一个安全可靠的远程桌面解决方案。Docker容器化部署使得管理和扩展变得更加简单，适合个人和企业使用。</p><hr><p><strong>参考资料：</strong></p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/lejianwen/rustdesk-api">rustdesk-api GitHub仓库</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/lejianwen/rustdesk-api/wiki/Use-Docker-With-Rustdesk-Server-S6">使用Docker部署文档</a></li></ul>]]>
